"She was sent north to turn the sealed Hollow into a blight dungeon, far from any Pillar's eye."
"She feeds the Hollow's core blightstones from corrupted beasts she makes with a ritual knife."
"She keeps her notes and a Night Order seal-stone under the hearthstone of her hut."
"She reports by seal-stone each new moon to a handler she knows only as the Lantern."
